{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1451249-aberrant-crafting-a-cure-and-other-ideas","id":1451249,"title":"[Aberrant] Crafting a cure, and other ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-07T13:21:37-07:00","id":1451249,"title":"[Aberrant] Crafting a cure, and other ideas","content":"I've been trying to figure out how to model one of the core tech cures mentioned in Aberrant 2e, but the rules seem geared towards hardware rather than vaccines, software, etc. <br /> <br /> The only method that comes to my mind at the moment is crafting a serum that has Immunity 1-5 with the Intrinsic tag. Would I also need to include some degree of M-Sta to utilize this mega edge? I'm also thinking the serum would need to have the Bestow tag to indicate that it imparts the Immunity to the patient (rather than having the edge be a property that protects the serum)?<br /> <br /> I've found the crafting rules pretty difficult to follow; if anyone has any tips or examples, I would be grateful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25790-sparda104","name":"Sparda104","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-07T16:29:02-07:00","id":1451265,"title":"","content":"I tend think you handle those without rules since its not a technical device. You set a difficulty, milestones and what not like normal, but there no utilitarian product to hold in your hand to use. Its not as if you will use the cure for cancer in combat or to solve a riddle. In general super science is for crafting items but I think it can serve for other things. The Adventure manuscript touches on this briefly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1580-andrewm9","name":"andrewm9","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-08T06:28:26-07:00","id":1451302,"title":"","content":"Trinity Core, p.93, &quot;compounds&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-16T14:37:00-07:00","id":1452537,"title":"","content":"for curing: I would basically use the Heal power with some negative tags restricting it to a certain disease/ adding in an amount of time for it to work. Make it a single use item (flaw). Then you just have to &quot;invent&quot; it 3 times. That it is a small injectable treatment etc.<br /> <br /> For vaccines: I would make it Immunity mege-edge with Impose, Intrinsic, and several negative tags similar to the cure as well as the single use item flaw.<br /> <br /> If the players are crafty they could then use this template to start making semi-super humans based off of similar logic to start crafting a way for them to get &quot;free&quot; powers/mega-attributes/mega-edges. just make sure the line is clearly discussed. It is relatively easy for a mega inventor to make a nova-tech injection or pill that would give them permanent Mega-attribute 5 ...This can be repeated for several other powers/mega-attributes/mega-edges.<br /> <br /> Intrinsic Transform 5 (maybe with some edges) as novatech is not difficult to accomplish for a good inventor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-17T04:35:01-07:00","id":1452610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Timecrafter</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1451249-aberrant-crafting-a-cure-and-other-ideas?p=1451302#post1451302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Trinity Core, p.93, &quot;compounds&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Crafting is not about technical things. The rules can be used for creating a plant that can make someone smarter. You Craft the plant that uses the Bestow Tag on Mega-Intellect 1.<br /> <br /> Sure, they do talk about mechanical devices but there is, literally, nothing that says you are limited to that.<br /> <br /> In Adventure!, they gave a sample device which is a mathematical formula that lets you affect an organization.<br /> <br /> You can make a drink that gives you super powers for an hour.<br /> <br /> The Crafting rules allow you to create an item to do something more than you, or your allies, can do normally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-17T05:48:52-07:00","id":1452612,"title":"","content":"In Aeon, the Chinese government works under a set of social rules and laws that is so complex and perfect that nobody can change without impacting the rest of the society. It\u2019s a Social Super Science created by a Nova before the Aberrant war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-17T12:41:30-07:00","id":1452672,"title":"","content":"Anybody else want to make a nova-tech version of lycanthropy (Impose, Intrinsic, Transformation (highly restricted (only certain things and can't shift the dots, uncontrolled at full moon etc), probably a couple of Extra Traits edges? infect people with it, sit back and watch the lunacy, also potentially something for an adversary to do to make some cool minions","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-17T12:56:17-07:00","id":1452679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>econclark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1451249-aberrant-crafting-a-cure-and-other-ideas?p=1452672#post1452672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anybody else want to make a nova-tech version of lycanthropy (Impose, Intrinsic, Transformation (highly restricted (only certain things and can't shift the dots, uncontrolled at full moon etc), probably a couple of Extra Traits edges? infect people with it, sit back and watch the lunacy, also potentially something for an adversary to do to make some cool minions</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be tempted to dig out the Aeon rules and start giving out points of flux to the minions. Um, actually isn't there a power for these kinds of alterations in Aeon?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25593-drsteve","name":"DrSteve","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-17T14:28:34-07:00","id":1452693,"title":"","content":"yeah, but only to yourself. With Bio-kinesis, you can easily make yourself a lycanthrope, but can't infect others...Aeon does have the amphibious varieties, so we know that this type of alteration is possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-18T04:59:14-07:00","id":1452756,"title":"","content":"If you sync with a Vitakinetic, though, you could do it with BK.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-18T07:20:16-07:00","id":1452770,"title":"","content":"That only gives an enhancement. You would need a Psiad with both powers to combine them (which is extremely rare).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-18T08:11:09-07:00","id":1452778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> For example, biokinetics \u2014 who can only use their powers on themselves \u2014 can combine with vitakinetics to access the noetic templates of others and shapeshift them. </div> </div> </div>It's hidden on p. 207, but it's there in the next to last paragraph on the page.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-18T09:11:29-07:00","id":1452790,"title":"","content":"There is a reference to Reconstruir, the work of a BK and a VK to Shapeshift a target for a limited period of time (that can last for days with powerful enough Psions) used in South America. There is a very interesting CC focused exclusively on it too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-18T09:45:33-07:00","id":1452792,"title":"","content":"That is pretty cool and interesting. I legitimately thought it was the realm of Psiads only. I would be wary of allowing that kind of thing with characters in game, but it could be explored further in another further future setting (potentially), as Psions start to break through the barriers and Psions/Psiads get closer and closer to the point of ascension.<br /> <br /> Maybe if they make that one they could call it Aescendency <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24929-econclark","name":"econclark","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-18T10:10:31-07:00","id":1452797,"title":"","content":"I consider it a legacy of what psiads can do and allowed it, since it encourages psions to link up, which is such a cool idea in my book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-06-18T10:32:12-07:00","id":1452803,"title":"","content":"Prometheus Unbound will have more examples of combining powers from multiple Psions to get awesome results.<br /> <br /> Anxious to get my hand is that book... but so far we need to wait...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}